\item[S2] Ben Green, 100 Open Problems (author’s maintained problem list). \url{https://people.maths.ox.ac.uk/greenbj/papers/open-problems.pdf}. The author-hosted document was inspected on 27 September 2026; the archive’s local code is not a problem-number locator in this paper.

